{"questionId":"u03-s009-v011","unitId":"u03","numericUnitId":3,"topicId":"u03-linear-equation-apps","skillId":"linear-equation-money-problem","difficulty":"literacy","type":"mc","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"sourceScope":"CAP_108_JUNIOR_MATH","text":"健身課年費 600 元，每堂另收 80 元。全年共付 1240 元，參加幾堂？","choices":["8","640","15.5","23"],"answerIndex":0,"explanation":"扣除年費600；課程費640；除80得8堂。所以答案是「8」。","steps":["扣除年費600","課程費640","除80得8堂"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"8","truth":true,"reason":"600+80x=1240，所以 80x=640，x=8。"},{"choice":"640","truth":false,"reason":"做到 80x=640 就把 640 當成堂數。"},{"choice":"15.5","truth":false,"reason":"忽略固定年費，直接算 1240÷80=15.5。"},{"choice":"23","truth":false,"reason":"把固定年費方向做反，算 (1240+600)÷80=23。"}],"commonMistake":"忽略年費。","concept":"固定年費不可平均成額外堂數。","tags":["代數","金錢問題","literacy"],"estimatedTimeSec":"75","prerequisiteSkillIds":["linear-equation-age-problem"],"authoringIntent":"由年費與單堂費求堂數。","literacyContextNecessity":"固定年費與逐堂收費決定600+80x，堂數還必須為非負整數。","reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentSha256":"f058aadd6e9cdf2278623ee8c33bcc042edd853e491c2b2888a19c6d872a350d","contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1","legacyContentDisposition":"replace-old-record-at-final-integration"}
